<!--
  Adaptive launcher foreground — the ORIGINAL shield-and-check mark, restored at
  the user's request.

  Deliberately different from the tile/notification chevron: the launcher icon is
  seen large, in colour, on a busy home screen, where a filled shield reads as
  "protection" instantly. The tile icon is seen tiny and monochrome, where a
  stroked chevron survives better. Two marks, each fit for its own context.

  Scaled to sit inside the adaptive icon's safe zone — the outer ~18% of the
  108dp canvas can be masked by the launcher.
-->
